{`v`:`story_v1`,`room`:`QTY`,`title`:`The Market Scales`,`titleVN`:`Chi\u1ebfc c\u00e2n \u1edf ch\u1ee3`,`cast`:[{`name`:`Sen`,`vn`:`c\u00f4 b\u00e9 12 tu\u1ed5i gi\u00fap m\u1eb9 b\u00e1n hoa qu\u1ea3 \u1edf ch\u1ee3, gi\u1ecfi \u0111\u1ebfm, hay \u0111\u1ed1 m\u1eb9o`},{`name`:`Mrs Hue`,`vn`:`c\u00f4 Hu\u1ec7, 41 tu\u1ed5i, m\u1eb9 c\u1ee7a Sen, ng\u01b0\u1eddi b\u00e1n hoa qu\u1ea3 th\u1eadt th\u00e0`}],`ch`:[{`floor`:`A1`,`part`:1,`parts`:3,`title`:`Five Customers`,`titleVN`:`N\u0103m v\u1ecb kh\u00e1ch`,`words`:`one|two|three|four|five|six|seven|eight|nine|ten|eleven|twelve|first|second|third|fourth|fifth|every|each`,`paras`:[{`en`:`Sen [[is|be]] [[twelve]]. [[Every]] [[morning]], [[she]] [[gets|get]] [[up]] [[at]] [[five]] [[o'clock]]. [[She]] [[goes|go]] [[to]] [[the]] [[market]] [[with]] [[her]] [[mother]], Mrs Hue. Mrs Hue [[sells|sell]] [[fruit]]. Sen [[helps|help]] [[her]], [[and]] [[she]] [[counts|count]] [[everything]]. [[At]] [[six]], [[the]] [[table]] [[is|be]] [[ready]]. [[There]] [[are|be]] [[nine]] [[boxes|box]] [[of]] [[oranges|orange]], [[four]] [[of]] [[bananas|banana]] [[and]] [[two]] [[of]] [[apples|apple]].`,`vn`:`Sen m\u01b0\u1eddi hai tu\u1ed5i. S\u00e1ng n\u00e0o c\u00f4 b\u00e9 c\u0169ng d\u1eady t\u1eeb n\u0103m gi\u1edd, theo m\u1eb9 l\u00e0 c\u00f4 Hu\u1ec7 ra ch\u1ee3. C\u00f4 Hu\u1ec7 b\u00e1n hoa qu\u1ea3. Sen ph\u1ee5 m\u1eb9, v\u00e0 c\u00e1i g\u00ec c\u00f4 b\u00e9 c\u0169ng \u0111\u1ebfm. S\u00e1u gi\u1edd, s\u1ea1p h\u00e0ng \u0111\u00e3 b\u00e0y xong: ch\u00edn th\u00f9ng cam, b\u1ed1n th\u00f9ng chu\u1ed1i v\u00e0 hai th\u00f9ng t\u00e1o.`},{`en`:`Sen [[has|have]] [[a]] [[question]] [[for]] [[every]] [[customer]]. [[The]] [[first]] [[customer]] [[is|be]] Grandma Lan. \`[[Two]] kilos [[of]] [[oranges|orange]], [[please]].\` \`Grandma Lan, [[which]] [[is|be]] [[more]]: [[a]] kilo [[of]] [[apples|apple]] [[or]] [[a]] kilo [[of]] [[bananas|banana]]?\` \`[[Apples|apple]],\` [[says|say]] Grandma Lan. \`[[No]]!\` [[laughs|laugh]] Sen. \`[[A]] kilo [[is|be]] [[a]] kilo!\` Mrs Hue [[smiles|smile]]. [[She]] [[says|say]] [[that]] [[every]] [[day]].`,`vn`:`V\u1ecb kh\u00e1ch n\u00e0o Sen c\u0169ng \u0111\u1ed1 m\u1ed9t c\u00e2u. V\u1ecb kh\u00e1ch th\u1ee9 nh\u1ea5t l\u00e0 b\u00e0 Lan. \`Cho b\u00e0 hai c\u00e2n cam.\` \`B\u00e0 Lan \u01a1i, m\u1ed9t c\u00e2n t\u00e1o v\u1edbi m\u1ed9t c\u00e2n chu\u1ed1i, c\u00e1i n\u00e0o nhi\u1ec1u h\u01a1n \u1ea1?\` \`T\u00e1o,\` b\u00e0 Lan \u0111\u00e1p. \`Sai r\u1ed3i!\` Sen c\u01b0\u1eddi. \`M\u1ed9t c\u00e2n l\u00e0 m\u1ed9t c\u00e2n!\` C\u00f4 Hu\u1ec7 m\u1ec9m c\u01b0\u1eddi. Ng\u00e0y n\u00e0o c\u00f4 c\u0169ng n\u00f3i c\u00e2u \u1ea5y.`},{`en`:`[[The]] [[second]] [[customer]] [[is|be]] Mr Bach [[from]] [[the]] [[clock]] [[shop]]. [[He]] [[comes|come]] [[at]] [[six]] [[o'clock]], [[not]] [[one]] [[minute]] [[late]]. \`[[Every]] [[minute]] [[counts|count]],\` [[he]] [[says|say]]. [[He]] [[wants|want]] [[seven]] [[bananas|banana]]. \`[[Why]] [[seven]]?\` [[asks|ask]] Sen. \`[[One]] [[for]] [[each]] [[day]] [[of]] [[the]] [[week]],\` [[says|say]] Mr Bach.`,`vn`:`V\u1ecb kh\u00e1ch th\u1ee9 hai l\u00e0 \u00f4ng B\u00e1ch \u1edf ti\u1ec7m \u0111\u1ed3ng h\u1ed3. \u00d4ng \u0111\u1ebfn \u0111\u00fang s\u00e1u gi\u1edd, kh\u00f4ng mu\u1ed9n m\u1ed9t ph\u00fat. \`T\u1eebng ph\u00fat \u0111\u1ec1u qu\u00fd,\` \u00f4ng n\u00f3i. \u00d4ng mua b\u1ea3y qu\u1ea3 chu\u1ed1i. \`Sao l\u1ea1i l\u00e0 b\u1ea3y \u1ea1?\` Sen h\u1ecfi. \`M\u1ed7i ng\u00e0y trong tu\u1ea7n m\u1ed9t qu\u1ea3,\` \u00f4ng B\u00e1ch \u0111\u00e1p.`},{`en`:`[[The]] [[third]] [[customer]] [[is|be]] [[little]] Bin. [[He]] [[has|have]] [[ten]] [[thousand]]. \`[[Each]] [[apple]] [[is|be]] [[three]] [[thousand]],\` [[says|say]] Sen. \`[[How]] [[many]] [[can]] [[I]] [[have]]?\` [[asks|ask]] Bin. \`[[Three]] [[apples|apple]], [[and]] [[one]] [[thousand]] [[back]],\` [[says|say]] Sen. Bin [[puts|put]] [[one]] [[apple]] [[in]] [[his]] [[mouth]] [[and]] [[two]] [[in]] [[his]] [[bag]].`,`vn`:`V\u1ecb kh\u00e1ch th\u1ee9 ba l\u00e0 b\u00e9 Bin. C\u1eadu c\u00f3 m\u01b0\u1eddi ngh\u00ecn. \`M\u1ed7i qu\u1ea3 t\u00e1o ba ngh\u00ecn,\` Sen n\u00f3i. \`Th\u1ebf em mua \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c m\u1ea5y qu\u1ea3 \u1ea1?\` Bin h\u1ecfi. \`Ba qu\u1ea3, ch\u1ecb tr\u1ea3 l\u1ea1i em m\u1ed9t ngh\u00ecn,\` Sen n\u00f3i. Bin nh\u00e9t ngay m\u1ed9t qu\u1ea3 v\u00e0o mi\u1ec7ng, hai qu\u1ea3 v\u00e0o t\u00fai.`},{`en`:`[[The]] [[fourth]] [[customer]] [[is|be]] Hien. [[She]] [[wants|want]] [[eleven]] [[oranges|orange]] [[for]] [[her]] [[drinks|drink]]. \`[[Take]] [[twelve]],\` [[says|say]] Mrs Hue. \`[[The]] [[last]] [[one]] [[is|be]] [[a]] [[present]].\` Hien [[says|say]] [[thank]] [[you]] [[eight]] [[times|time]].`,`vn`:`V\u1ecb kh\u00e1ch th\u1ee9 t\u01b0 l\u00e0 Hi\u1ec1n. C\u00f4 b\u00e9 mua m\u01b0\u1eddi m\u1ed9t qu\u1ea3 cam \u0111\u1ec3 pha n\u01b0\u1edbc. \`L\u1ea5y m\u01b0\u1eddi hai qu\u1ea3 \u0111i ch\u00e1u,\` c\u00f4 Hu\u1ec7 n\u00f3i. \`Qu\u1ea3 cu\u1ed1i c\u00f4 t\u1eb7ng.\` Hi\u1ec1n c\u1ea3m \u01a1n \u0111\u1ebfn t\u00e1m l\u1ea7n.`},{`en`:`[[Then]] [[the]] [[fifth]] [[customer]] [[comes|come]]. [[It]] [[is|be]] Mr Long, [[a]] [[teacher]] [[from]] Lotus School. \`[[I]] [[need]] [[fruit]] [[for]] [[my]] [[class]],\` [[he]] [[says|say]]. \`[[But]] [[first]], [[I]] [[have]] [[a]] [[number]] [[question]] [[for]] [[you]], Sen.\``,`vn`:`R\u1ed3i v\u1ecb kh\u00e1ch th\u1ee9 n\u0103m \u0111\u1ebfn. \u0110\u00f3 l\u00e0 th\u1ea7y Long, th\u1ea7y d\u1ea1y to\u00e1n \u1edf tr\u01b0\u1eddng Hoa Sen. \`Th\u1ea7y c\u1ea7n mua hoa qu\u1ea3 cho l\u1edbp,\` th\u1ea7y n\u00f3i. \`Nh\u01b0ng tr\u01b0\u1edbc h\u1ebft, th\u1ea7y c\u00f3 m\u1ed9t c\u00e2u \u0111\u1ed1 to\u00e1n cho Sen.\``}],`tease`:`Th\u1ea7y Long \u0111\u1ed1 Sen c\u00e2u g\u00ec, v\u00e0 c\u00f4 b\u00e9 c\u00f3 tr\u1ea3 l\u1eddi \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c kh\u00f4ng?`}]}